=== Wales ===
On 31 August, Wales announced their 31-man squad.<ref>{{cite news |title=Gatland mixes the old with the new in RWC selection |url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/87238 |publisher=Rugby World Cup |date=31 August 2015 |access-date=31 August 2015 }}</ref>

After injuries to [[Rhys Webb]] and [[Leigh Halfpenny]] during Wales' warm-up match against Italy, Mike Philips and Eli Walker were called up to replace the injured duo.<ref>{{cite news |title=Wales lose Webb for Rugby World Cup |url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/34183785 |publisher=BBC Sport (British Broadcasting Corporation) |date=8 September 2015 |access-date=8 September 2015}}</ref>

On 14 September, Eli Walker was released from the squad following injury and was replaced with Ross Moriarty.<ref>{{cite news|title=Eli Walker delivers fresh blow to Wales|url=https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/rugby-union/34251954|publisher=BBC Sport (British Broadcasting Corporation) |date=14 September 2015 |access-date=14 September 2015}}</ref>

<sup>1</sup> On 21 September, Tyler Morgan was called up to the squad to replace Cory Allen who tore his hamstring in Wales's opening win against Uruguay.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/96374|title=Wales centre Cory Allen ruled out of RWC 2015 with hamstring injury|publisher=Rugby World Cup|date=21 September 2015|access-date=21 September 2015}}</ref>

<sup>2</sup> On 28 September, Gareth Anscombe and James Hook were called up to the squad to replace Hallam Amos and Scott Williams who were injured in Wales's win against England.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/101913|title=Wales lose two and call in James Hook and Gareth Anscombe|publisher=Rugby World Cup|date=28 September 2015|access-date=28 September 2015}}</ref>

<sup>3</sup> On 11 October, Liam Williams was ruled out of the World Cup having suffered an injury against Australia, and Eli Walker re-joined the squad to replace him. Walker was allowed to re-join the squad, as he was released from the team before Wales officially arrived in tournament.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/111897|title=Eli Walker replaces injured Liam Williams in Wales squad|publisher=Rugby World Cup|date=13 October 2015|access-date=13 October 2015}}</ref>

