== Pool C ==

=== Argentina ===
On 16 August, Argentina announced their initial 31-man squad.<ref>{{cite news |title=Few surprises as Hourcade names RWC 2015 squad |url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/85200 |publisher=Rugby World Cup |date=16 August 2015 |access-date=17 August 2015}}</ref>

Hours after the 31-man squad was announced, [[Matías Díaz]] suffered an injury and was replaced in the squad by Juan Pablo Orlandi.<ref>{{cite news |title=Matías Díaz es baja en el plantel para RWC 2015 |url=http://www.uar.com.ar/noticias/noticias.asp?idinfo=4219 |publisher=UAR |date=16 August 2015 |access-date=21 August 2015 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150820113845/http://www.uar.com.ar/noticias/noticias.asp?idinfo=4219 |archive-date=2015-08-20 |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref name="Argentina squad - RWC2015">{{cite web |url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/argentina/squad |title=Argentina squad - RWC2015 |work=RWC2015 |access-date=18 August 2019 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20150920061757/http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/argentina/squad |archive-date=20 September 2015 |url-status=dead }}</ref>

<sup>1</sup> On 15 October, Juan Figallo was called up to the squad to replace Nahuel Tetaz Chaparro after he suffered an injury in training.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/112499|title=Pumas call up Juan Figallo for injured prop Nahuel Tetaz Chaparro|publisher=Rugby World Cup|date=15 October 2015|access-date=15 October 2015}}</ref>

<sup>2</sup> Due to an injury to Agustín Creevy, usual prop Lucas Noguera Paz will cover hooker from the bench against South Africa in the [[2015 Rugby World Cup knockout stage#Bronze Final: South Africa vs Argentina|Bronze Final]]. However, an injury sustained in training for prop Marcos Ayerza ruled him out of the Bronze Final the day before the match, and Santiago García Botta was called up as his replacement. As there was no further cover for prop, García Botta was cleared to play in the match, despite the stand-down period of 48 hours before an injury replacement can take the field, though he is only permitted to play if absolutely required.<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.rugbyworldcup.com/news/119756|title=Injured Marcos Ayerza ruled out of Argentina's team for bronze final|publisher=Rugby World Cup|date=30 October 2015|access-date=30 October 2015}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.americasrugbynews.com/2015/10/29/ayerza-out-of-bronze-final/|title=Ayerza out of Bronze Final|publisher=Americas Rugby News|date=29 October 2015|access-date=29 October 2015}}</ref>

